This project allows for reproduction of results in the "Real-world performance of AI-based tumor cell content quantification for molecular tumor profiling in diagnostic cancer samples" paper.


To just reproduce the output, run
````bash
nextflow run main.nf -resume
````

Or have a look at the main.nf for the order and logic of the pipeline

You can also just go from 00 to 05 manually, but mind the dependencies; 00 and 01 should always be loaded, and 04 for everything above 04.